	(text "U801 switches the 3.3 V screen supply (+3V3_UI) and reports overcurrent.\nCurrent-limit range: 234 to 303 mA (R803 100k 0.1%, S-25); panel + touch ~40 mA max. \nNo bulk cap on +3V3_UI (C68 removed, S-12):\nno 190 mA inrush on +3V3_D at UI_EN; firmware UI power-cycle guard >= 50 ms.\nBacklight (LED-A) is fed from VSYS via F801/Q802, switched by UI_EN."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 61.595 114.3 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5e0c1089-6e31-4d5d-9d78-ea99d83faea4")
	)
