	(text "J801: Newhaven NHD-2.4-240320AF-CSXP-CTP (ST7789Vi, 8080-II 8-bit on DB8-DB15, write-only)\nvia Omron XF2M-4015-1A; also fits NHD-2.8-...-FCTP. IM2:IM0 = 001 hard-tied (NHD Interface Selection p.5);\nRDX (J801.13) tied to +3V3_UI, PD4 (FMC_NOE) unused: firmware never reads the panel (S-11).\nJ802: FT5426 touch (I2C2, 0x38). FMC bank 1 NE1, D/C = A22; TE (J801.40) not connected (FEAT-6).\nDisplay and backlight are unpowered (UI_EN low) during acquisition."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 154.432 60.198 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
