		(property "Function" "100k pull-down holding LCD_RST (J801.30 RESX) low while U401 PA2 is analog or in reset; with the CS/WR pull-ups removed (S-11) it is also the hardware guard against spurious 8080 writes while the panel is powered and FMC is undriven (ST7789V 8.16: RESX has priority over CSX). Place near J801."
