		(property "Function" "100R series source termination of the 8080 D/C line: U401 pin 5 (PE6, FMC_A22) LCD_DC_MCU to LCD_DC (J801.11 DCX). 100R instead of the arrays' 47R: same BOM line as R1006/R1220 (no new line) and slower edges on the FPC; D/C setup to WRX is 0 ns min (ST7789V 8080-II) and 100R x ~15 pF is ~1.5 ns. P1-20: D/C left RN803 so the array serves the U401 south-row pins only. R804 sits on B under U401 on the existing D/C F escape (via-in-pad on pin 1): 4.86 mm of F track, was 11.1 mm to RN803. A site at pin 5 is not connectable: any via there falls inside K17_LSE_GUARD (B) or within 0.15 mm of U401.6 VBAT_RTC."
			(at 129.54 101.6 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
