		(property "Function" "SC-11: 1k in series between the SW801 button line (RECORD_N) and the C807/U401 pin 2 node (RECORD_N_MCU, pulled up by the PE3 internal pull-up; R44 removed, FEAT-5). Limits the C807 discharge on a press to 3.3 mA and damps the long button trace with C807 (low-pass); pressed level 3.3 V x 1k/41k = 0.08 V (40k typ internal pull-up), below VIL 0.3 x VDD. B side at the U401 end of the line."
